<title>UK: TABLE-BSkyB yr pretax profit 313.7 mln stg.</title>
<headline>TABLE-BSkyB yr pretax profit 313.7 mln stg.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-08-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to June 30, 1997.</p>
<p>			   (million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (pence)		  16.8		 vs    13.6</p>
<p> Dividend (pence)	    3.25		vs     3.00</p>
<p> Total dividend (pence)    6.00		vs     5.50</p>
<p> Pretax			313.7		 vs   257.4</p>
<p> Turnover		  1,270.0		 vs 1,008.1</p>
<p>NOTE - Analysts had forecast pre-tax profits in a range between 300 and 305 million stg. The company said its operating profits, which stood at 374 million stg, benefited from a contribution of 14 million stg relating to an agreement to continue to supply certain programming to British Digital Broadcasting following BSkyB's withdrawal from the consortium.</p>
<p>Full company name - British Sky Broadcasting Group Plc</p>
